{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49862","headline":"临江仙 · 冯延巳","name":"临江仙","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"冷红飘起桃花片，青春意绪阑珊。\n高楼帘幕卷轻寒，酒余人散，独自倚阑干。\n夕阳千里连芳草，风光愁杀王孙。\n徘徊飞尽碧天云，凤城何处，明月照黄昏。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"冯延巳","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49862.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49862","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}